// Stormglass Commons Character Appearance H3E.
//
// This read-only look-development composition upgrades H3D layered eyes with an
// opt-in native orbital fit. Each globe is recessed behind real upper/lower skin
// shells whose inner edges form an almond aperture with mirrored canthal shaping.
// The witness remains a bounded procedural foundation: it is not scan-derived
// anatomy, a production eyelash/tear-film system, or a photorealism claim.

